[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
MDWeb has been installed.

1. Set a strong JWT secret (required in production):

     install -m 0600 /usr/local/etc/mdweb/mdweb.env.sample \
       /usr/local/etc/mdweb.env
     # edit /usr/local/etc/mdweb.env and set JWT_SECRET

2. Copy sample config if needed:

     cp /usr/local/etc/mdweb/config.json.sample \
       /usr/local/etc/mdweb/config.json
     cp /usr/local/etc/mdweb/users.json.sample \
       /usr/local/etc/mdweb/users.json
     chown www:www /usr/local/etc/mdweb/users.json
     chmod 0600 /usr/local/etc/mdweb/users.json

3. Change the default admin password immediately
   (default is admin / admin until you change it):

     cd /usr/local/www/mdweb && \
       env CONFIG_DIR=/usr/local/etc/mdweb \
       ./node_modules/.bin/tsx server/scripts/change-password.ts admin 'your-strong-password'

4. Enable and start the service:

     sysrc mdweb_enable=YES
     service mdweb start

Health check: curl http://127.0.0.1:5173/api/health
EOM
}
]
